      "long": "A richly colored oil painting shows five figures in an intimate grouping. A central woman in a voluminous red dress with blue sleeves cradles a nude infant; the child touches her chin while she gazes down. To her left, a bearded man in grey leans in, his hand near a second nude infant standing barefoot beside a small white lamb. To the right, an older woman wearing a white head covering sits with hands resting on a wicker basket lined with cloth. The background is dark and indistinct, emphasizing the illuminated figures in the foreground.",
